{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_25273","headline":"赠毛仙翁 · 李宗闵","name":"赠毛仙翁","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"不知仙客占青春，肌骨才教称两旬。\n俗眼暂惊相见日，疑心未测几时人。\n闲推甲子经何代，笑说浮生老此身。\n残药傥能沾朽质，愿将霄汉永爲邻。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李宗闵","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_25273.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_25273","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}